<section class="steps-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="container"><div class="section-header reveal"><div class="section-badge"><span class="section-badge-dot"></span> How It Works</div><h2 class="section-title">From Zero to Compliant in 4 Steps</h2><p class="section-desc">Get audit-ready in weeks, not months. Our streamlined process eliminates the complexity of compliance.</p></div><div class="steps-grid"><div class="step-card reveal delay-1"><div class="step-num c1">1</div><h3>Connect &amp; Discover</h3><p>Integrate your cloud, SaaS, and DevOps tools. AI auto-discovers your infrastructure and maps your posture.</p></div><div class="step-card reveal delay-2"><div class="step-num c2">2</div><h3>Map &amp; Automate</h3><p>AI maps controls to frameworks and begins automated evidence collection, policy generation, and monitoring.</p></div><div class="step-card reveal delay-3"><div class="step-num c3">3</div><h3>Monitor &amp; Remediate</h3><p>Real-time dashboards show compliance health. AI identifies gaps and provides prioritized remediation steps.</p></div><div class="step-card reveal delay-4"><div class="step-num c4">4</div><h3>Audit &amp; Certify</h3><p>Streamlined auditor collaboration with dedicated audit portal, auto-organized evidence rooms, and post-cert monitoring.</p></div></div></div></section>

